{"3998560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trainz Simulator World Tour", "steam_appid": 3998560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Aboard for the Ultimate Train Driving Adventure: Trainz Simulator: World Tour! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver’s seat and embark on an epic train-driving experience. Trainz Simulator: World Tour takes you across 4 stunning locales in 3 countries, spanning the rugged landscapes of the USA, the iconic railways of Great Britain, and the untamed beauty of the Australian Outback.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore 4 Stunningly Detailed Routes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the immersive world of railroading with routes inspired by real-world locations:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coal Country, USA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/a7f475b0eceec446818f7444d60c0d2b.avif?t=1784089128\" width=670 height=924 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>West From Denver, USA (prototypical)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/4ae99c716783d4a14a5feec7cc01b916.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"west from denver\" width=670 height=924 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>East Coast Main Line: Edinburgh to Dundee, UK (prototypical)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/676b75f14b525de2ad1153d9a01c80f6.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"east coast main line ( ecml )\" width=670 height=924 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bairnsdale to Orbost, Australia (prototypical)</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/45e0bbbb9012feb7955f83527ec7dd23.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"bairnsdale to orbost\" width=670 height=924 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>16 Gameplay Sessions to Master</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 4 unique gameplay sessions per route, you’ll command a total of 16 immersive challenges. Begin your journey hauling coal in the USA before heading to the UK’s historic railways, and finally over to rural Australia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/dc52eda76e80c083484f85d24606113e.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"4 routes, 16 session\" width=670 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control Trains from Around the Globe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From powerful diesels to iconic steam locomotives, take charge of world-class engines, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CSX GP38-2 Diesel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UP GP38-2 Diesel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C&amp;O 2-8-4 Kanawha Steam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BR 9F Evening Star Steam</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BR HST Inter-City 125 Diesel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BR Class 40 Diesel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BR Class 47 Diesel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amtrack P42DC hauling Superliner Cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CSX SW1500 Switcher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BR Class 08 Shunter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR T Class Diesel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR K190 Steam</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that’s just the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/2524e683c15609bc6f5401ed7173a085.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"br hst - inter-city 125\" width=670 height=696 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/a7519b55c458b34e00c32dbe82ce4422.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"br 9f evening star\" width=670 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/d4c8cca5ea151b5e476ebfda577f7a85.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"up gp38-2\" width=670 height=696 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/f802a713404e4cd6297c9551e92e9fee.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"c&amp;amp;o 2-8-4 kanawha\" width=670 height=606 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998560/extras/b7a970c29c2331aff807fd0bdba0d490.avif?t=1784089128\" alt=\"trainz sim: world tour - more trains\" width=670 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a vast array of rolling stock to haul and missions to complete, every session offers a new and thrilling experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re shunting freight, racing against time, or navigating challenging terrains, Trainz Simulator: World Tour is your ticket to a brand new train-driving adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get on board today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Aboard for the Ultimate Train Driving Adventure: Trainz Simulator: World Tour! </p>